Actualy I have 189 genotypes that  I measured their root length growth in two condition stress and control  for qtl analysis I have done qtl analysis once with stress data , once with treat data .

But I think it's actually the difference between the two groups that  matters, not just the growth of the roots in stress condition.

, so I decided to do qtl anlysis with treat data but according to control data. I thought it was better that doing qtl analysis with stress data and adding control data as a covariate .
But I don't know if I think it's right. Thank you for guiding me and telling me how I can solve this problem.

